                                ;	SWEET.MAC
                                ;
                                ;	2026 TIKI 100 RESIDENT PT3 MUSIC DRIVER BY TOM BRAUTASET
                                ;
                                ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                ;	PURPOSE
                                ;
                                ;	Self-contained resident music driver for TIKI 100 / TIKO.
                                ;
                                ;	First invocation copies the resident image to 8000H, saves the original
                                ;	TIKO FF16H vector, initializes the player, installs the TSR and returns
                                ;	to TIKO while playback continues.
                                ;
                                ;	Running SWEET again mutes the AY-3-8912, restores the original TIKO vector
                                ;	and removes the resident hook.
                                ;
                                ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                ;	2026 TIKI 100 ADAPTATION
                                ;
                                ;	TIKI-specific work includes the TIKO resident integration, 125-to-50 Hz
                                ;	scheduler, TIKI AY-3-8912 output backend and low-overhead interrupt path.
                                ;
                                ;	The player core and music retain their original credits at the relevant
                                ;	source sections below.
                                ;
                                ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                ;	TARGET AND TOOLCHAIN
                                ;
                                ;	Target computer	: TIKI 100
                                ;	Operating system	: TIKO
                                ;	CPU				: Z80A, 4 MHz
                                ;	Assembler			: Microsoft MACRO-80 (M80)
                                ;	Linker			: Microsoft LINK-80	 (L80)
                                ;
                                ;	Suggested TIKO build:
                                ;
                                ;	M80 =SWEET/L/Z
                                ;	L80 SWEET,SWEET/N/E
                                ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                	.Z80
